        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this minimalist tower defense game, <strong>bullets are not just weapons—they are resources</strong>.<br>You must produce bullets through defense towers and use various buildings to transport, split, accelerate, or transform them, creating your own <strong>automated bullet factory</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies won’t attack directly but instead interfere with your defenses through special abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some disable nearby towers upon death;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some dash forward, ignore slows, or rapidly respawn;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll need to plan towers and buildings carefully to counter different enemy types across each path.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Automation</strong>: Produce, transport, and process bullets—efficient use is the key to survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Buildings</strong>: Redirect bullets, split them, speed them up, or even recycle them for continuous use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Enemy Design</strong>: Each path features different enemy types, forcing adaptive strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Maps</strong>: From compact arenas to sprawling multi-path layouts, each map demands new solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about <strong>construction and planning</strong>—not just stacking towers, but ensuring every bullet flows where it’s needed.<br><strong>Can your defense factory hold out until the end?</strong></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this minimalist tower defense game, <strong>bullets are not just weapons—they are resources</strong>.<br>You must produce bullets through defense towers and use various buildings to transport, split, accelerate, or transform them, creating your own <strong>automated bullet factory</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies won’t attack directly but instead interfere with your defenses through special abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some disable nearby towers upon death;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some dash forward, ignore slows, or rapidly respawn;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll need to plan towers and buildings carefully to counter different enemy types across each path.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Automation</strong>: Produce, transport, and process bullets—efficient use is the key to survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Buildings</strong>: Redirect bullets, split them, speed them up, or even recycle them for continuous use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Enemy Design</strong>: Each path features different enemy types, forcing adaptive strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Maps</strong>: From compact arenas to sprawling multi-path layouts, each map demands new solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about <strong>construction and planning</strong>—not just stacking towers, but ensuring every bullet flows where it’s needed.<br><strong>Can your defense factory hold out until the end?</strong></p></li></ul>",
